# apps/docs/_headers — Cloudflare Pages HTTP headers
# Mirrors in-document typed links as HTTP Link headers per RFC 8288. Agents
# fetching with HEAD (or without parsing HTML) still discover the relevant
# service map or a page's true alternate representation.
#
# Doctrine: docs/AGENT-WEB-SURFACE.md (Move 4 — alternate-link discovery loop).
# Format: Cloudflare Pages _headers per https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/

# ── Global: substrate identity plus non-overlapping static hardening ──
#
# Docs contains legacy inline style attributes and event handlers. Exact
# hashes in the all-path Pages Worker authorize five inline script blocks,
# fourteen handler bodies, and forty-six style blocks. Its style-src-attr
# allowance is explicit and limited to legacy attributes. That Worker fills
# only absent headers, so stricter policies below remain exact and unduplicated.
# HSTS remains at the estate's initial five-minute observation stage; do not
# add includeSubDomains/preload or raise the age without a separate rollout.
